{"id":684,"date":"2018-11-15T10:02:30","modified":"2026-04-22T08:44:10","link":"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/cjenovnik\/","title":{"rendered":"Cjenovnik"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"684\" class=\"elementor elementor-684\" data-elementor-settings=\"{&quot;ha_cmc_init_switcher&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-479c47f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"479c47f\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b2262b0\" data-id=\"b2262b0\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b021cde elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b021cde\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/opsta-medicina-porodicna-medicina\/\">OP\u0160TA\/PORODI\u010cNA MEDICINA\n<\/a><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ce4d37 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2ce4d37\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Pregled specijaliste porodi\u010dne medicine \u2013 20\u20ac<\/li><li>Kontrolni pregled specijaliste porodi\u010dne medicine\u00a0 \u2013 15\u20ac<\/li><li>Prva ku\u0107na posjeta specijaliste \u2013 50\u20ac<\/li><li><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );\">Davanje terapije u ordinaciji &#8211; BESPLATNO (nije uklju\u010dena cijena medikamenata)<\/span><\/li><li>Davanje terapije u ku\u0107i -10\u20ac\/dan (nije uklju\u010dena cijena medikamenata)<\/li><li>Ugovor za \u201cVa\u0161 doktor\u201d-\u201cVa\u0161a poliklinika-80\u20ac\/mjese\u010dno<\/li><li>Ugovor za \u201cVa\u0161 doktor\u201d-\u201cVa\u0161a poliklinika-40\u20ac\/mjese\u010dno (\u010dlan u\u017ee porodice)<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e7a450 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5e7a450\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">TERAPIJA <\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a3859c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a3859c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Intramuskularna injekcija (uklju\u010duje 1 lijek) &#8211; 5\u20ac\u00a0<\/li><li>Intramuskularna injekcija (uklju\u010duje 2+ lijeka) &#8211; 10\u20ac\u00a0<\/li><li>Infuzija &#8211; 10 \u20ac<\/li><li>Infuzija manitol &#8211; 10 \u20ac<\/li><li>Infuzija (uklju\u010duje 1-2 lijeka) &#8211; 15\u20ac<\/li><li>Infuzija (uklju\u010duje 3 lijeka ) &#8211; 20 \u20ac<\/li><li>Infuzija (uklju\u010duje antibiotik) &#8211; 20\u20ac<\/li><li>Infuzija (uklju\u010duje 2+ lijeka i antibiotik ) &#8211; 25\u20ac<\/li><li>Aplikacija terapije u ku\u0107nim uslovima &#8211; 10 \u20ac (nije uklju\u010dena cijena medikamenata)<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dfea838 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dfea838\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">MEDICINA RADA\n<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11023fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"11023fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>prvi pregled specijaliste medicine rada &#8211; 30\u20ac<\/li><li>kontrolni pregled specijaliste medicine rada \u2013 25\u20ac<\/li><li>pregled za ocjenu preostale radne sposobnosti \u2013 35\u20ac<\/li><li>konzilijarni pregld za ocjenu preostale radne sposobnosti -50\u20ac<\/li><\/ul><h4>Ljekarsko uvjerenje za sportiste:<\/h4><ul><li>do 10 godina &#8211; 10\u20ac<\/li><li>11-17 godina &#8211; 15\u20ac<\/li><li>18+ godina &#8211; 20\u20ac<\/li><\/ul><h4>Ljekarsko uvjerenje za voza\u010de:<\/h4><ul><li>ljekarsko uvjerenje za polaganje A,B kategorije &#8211; 20\u20ac<\/li><li>ljekarsko\u00a0 uvjerenje za polaganje C,D,E kategorije &#8211; 25\u20ac<\/li><li>ljekarsko uvjerenje za produ\u017eenje voza\u010dke dozvole A,B,C,D,E kategorije &#8211;\u00a0<s style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );\"><span lang=\"SR-LATN-ME\">25<\/span><\/s>\u20ac\u00a0\u00a0 20\u20ac<\/li><\/ul><h4>Uvjerenje o zdravstvenoj sposobnosti-\u201cljekarsko uvjerenje\u201d <strong>za rad<\/strong> prilikom zasnivanja radnog odnosa za:<\/h4><ul><li>radna mjesta bez pove\u0107anog rizika (op\u0161ta zdravstvene sposobnost: slu\u017ebenici, konobari, kuvari, administrativni poslovi \u2026) &#8211; 20\u20ac<\/li><li>radna mjesta sa posebnim uslovima &#8211; 35\u20ac<\/li><li>radna mjesta sa pove\u0107anim rizikom (prethodni pregled) &#8211; 35\u20ac<\/li><li>obavljanje slu\u017ebe u Vojsci Crne Gore -35\u20ac<\/li><li>vatrogasca-35\u20ac<\/li><li>za\u0161titara (obezbje\u0111enje uz no\u0161enje oru\u017eja)-35\u20ac<\/li><li>portira (obezbje\u0111enje bez no\u0161enje oru\u017eja)-20\u20ac<\/li><\/ul><h4>uvjerenje o zdravstvenoj sposobnosti-\u201cljekarsko uvjerenje\u201d za<\/h4><ul><li>pomorca &#8211; 85\u20ac<\/li><li>sudskog vje\u0161taka &#8211; 35\u20ac\u00a0<\/li><li>posjedovanje vatrenog oru\u017eja &#8211; 35\u20ac\u00a0<\/li><li>upravljanje motornim vozilom za instruktore vo\u017enje &#8211; 30\u20ac<\/li><li>dobijanje licence za spasioca na vodi -30\u20ac<\/li><li>ronioca-profesionalca, rukovodioca i instruktora ronjenja-30\u20ac<\/li><li>upravitelja \u010damca-30\u20ac<\/li><li>upis u srednju \u0161kolu-saobra\u0107ajnog smjera -25\u20ac<\/li><li>sportske sudije-35\u20ac<\/li><li>boravak i rad u Crnoj Gori-20\u20ac<\/li><li>kolektivni smje\u0161taj za za ustanove socijalnog staranja-20\u20ac<\/li><li>podobnost za usvajanje djeteta, starateljstvo-20\u20ac<\/li><li>sklapanje braka za maloljetne osobe-20\u20ac;<\/li><li>radi \u017eivotnog osiguranja-20\u20ac;<\/li><li>upis na fakultet &#8211; 15\u20ac<\/li><li>dalji nastavak \u0161kolovanja i boravak u inostranstvu, izdavanje viza -15\u20ac<\/li><li>kolektivni smje\u0161taj za \u0111ake i studente &#8211; 15\u20ac<\/li><li>izdavanje duplikata uvjerenja-10\u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e0f36c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2e0f36c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/ginekologija-i-akuserstvo\/\">GINEKOLOGIJA I AKU\u0160ERSTVO\n<\/a><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57f0951 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"57f0951\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Ginekolo\u0161ko-aku\u0161erski pregled\u00a0 &#8212; 30,00 \u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled &#8211;30,00 \u20ac<\/li><li>Ginekolo\u0161ko-aku\u0161erski pregled\u00a0 sa ultrazvukom\u201450 \u20ac<\/li><li>Ginekolo\u0161ki pregled sa uzivamnje briseva\u201435 \u20ac<\/li><li>PAPA test I -15\u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-63c717b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"63c717b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/interna-medicina\/\">INTERNA MEDICINA\n<\/a><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-302dc10 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"302dc10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Pregledi:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Pregled interniste \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Pregled interniste (uklju\u010duje izrada razli\u010ditih programa pravilne ishrane) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Kontrolni pregled interniste \u2013 30\u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02e602e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"02e602e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/kardiologija\/\">KARDIOLOGIJA\n<\/a><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-938a1ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"938a1ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Pregledi :\u00a0<\/h4><ul><li>pregled kardiologa &#8211; 40<\/li><li>Kontrolni pregled kardiologa &#8211; 30\u00a0<\/li><\/ul><h4><strong>Neinvazivna dijagnostiku:<\/strong><\/h4><ul><li>Elektrokardiografija (EKG)- 5\u20ac<\/li><li>Holter krvnog pritiska 24 sata (holter TA) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Holter rada srca 24 sata (holter EKG) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvuk srca (UZV srca) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Pregled kardiologa i UZ srca &#8211; 60\u20ac<\/li><li>Test fizi\u010dkog optere\u0107enja (TFO)-ergometrija \u2013 60\u20ac<\/li><li>Dobutaminski test \u2013 80\u20ac<\/li><li>Stres ehokardiografski test (stres EHO) \u2013 80\u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8bb6aa0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8bb6aa0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/endokrinologija\/\">ENDOKRINOLOGIJA<\/a><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb1b4b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fb1b4b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Pregledi:<\/strong><\/h4><ul><li>Prvi pregled endokrinologa \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Kontrolni pregled endokrinologa \u2013 30\u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bcfe67e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bcfe67e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/reumatologija\/\">REUMATOLOGIJA<\/a><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa31448 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fa31448\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Neinvazivna dijagnostiku:<\/strong><\/h4><ul><li>Ultratvu\u010dni pregled ko\u0161tano-zglobnog sistem (rame, lakat, koljeno,sko\u010dni zglob) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><\/ul><h4><strong>Pregledi:<\/strong><\/h4><ul><li>Prvi pregled reumatologa (uklju\u010duje aplikaciju lijeka u zglob) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><\/ul><p>Kontrolni pregled reumatologa (uklju\u010duje aplikaciju lijeka u zglob) \u00a0\u2013 30\u20ac<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e912d8c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e912d8c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/hematologija\/\">HEMATOLOGIJA<\/a><\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66cd57f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"66cd57f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Pregledi:<\/strong><\/h4><ul><li>Prvi pregled hematologa \u2013 50\u20ac<\/li><li>Kontrolni pregled hematologa \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee26f93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ee26f93\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">MENTALNO ZDRAVLJE\n<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d49e8a9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d49e8a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Pregledi: <\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tretman psihoterapeuta &#8211; 40\u20ac&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Prvi pregled psihijatra \u2013 50\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>Kontrolni pregled psihijatra &#8211; 50\u20ac&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Prvi pregled neurologa &#8211; 40\u20ac&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Kontrolni pregled neurologa \u2013 30\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>Ku\u0107na posjeta psihijatra \u2013 70\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>Ku\u0107na posjeta neurologa \u2013 70\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>Tretman psihologa \u2013 30\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>Savjetovanje psihologa-20\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>Psiholo\u0161ka dijagnostika-45\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>Profesionalna orijetacija-45\u20ac<\/li>\n<li>\u0160kola roditeljstva (u malim grupama, 8-10 polaznika) cjena tematske cjeline -15\u20ac\/po osobi<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e262350 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e262350\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/radioloska-dijagnostika\/\">RADIOLO\u0160KA DIJAGNOSTIKA\n<\/a><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70c7208 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"70c7208\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled \u0161titne i para\u0161titne \u017elijezde \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled abdomena (jetre, \u017eu\u010dne kese, \u017eu\u010dnih puteva, gu\u0161tera\u010de, slezene, bubrega, nadbubrega, mokra\u0107ne be\u0161ike i limfnih \u017elijezda abdomena) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled bubrega, nadbubrega, mokra\u0107ne be\u0161ike i prostate \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled dojki \u2013 50\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled testisa \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled mekih tkiva \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled ko\u0161tano-zglobnog sistem (rame, lakat, koljeno,sko\u010dni zglob) \u2013 40\u20ac<\/li><li>Ultrazvu\u010dni pregled limfnih \u017elijezda (prepone, pazuha, potklju\u010dne i natklj\u010dne regije) \u2013 50\u20ac<\/li><li>dopler krvnih sudova vrata &#8211; 50 \u20ac<\/li><li>dopler krvnih sudova gornjih ekstremiteta &#8211; 50 \u20ac<\/li><li>dopler krvnih sudova donjih esktremiteta\u00a0 &#8211; 50 \u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47953d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"47953d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/radioloska-dijagnostika\/\">RENDGEN\n<\/a><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-904fb77 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"904fb77\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Rendgenski snimak (po segmentu) + opis &#8211; 25\u20ac\u00a0<\/li><li>Rendgenski snimak cijele ki\u010dme + opis &#8211; 60\u20ac\u00a0<\/li><li>Rendgenski snimak u ku\u0107nim uslovima + opis &#8211; 80\u20ac<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-122c861 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"122c861\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">KIROPRAKTIKA<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-963e474 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"963e474\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Prvi pregled kiroprakti\u010dara (uklju\u010duje i tretman) \u2013 35\u20ac<br \/>Kontrolni pregled kiroprakti\u010dara (uklju\u010duje i tretman) \u2013 35\u20ac<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3162b66 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3162b66\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">HID\u017dAMA ZA \u017dENE I MU\u0160KARCE\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e176d05 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e176d05\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTretman hid\u017eamom \u2013 30\u20ac\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-504d167 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"504d167\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/vasezdravlje.me\/laboratorijska-dijagnostika\/\">LABORATORIJSKA DIJAGNOSTIKA<br><\/a><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a86070 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7a86070\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Uzorkovanje u ordinaciji \u2013 BESPLATNO<\/p><p>Uzorkovanje u ku\u0107i \u2013 10\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>HEMATOLOGIJA:<\/strong><\/h4><p>KKS (kompletna krvna slika) \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>SE (sedimentacija eritrocita) \u2013 2\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>BIOHEMIJA<\/strong><\/h4><p>CRP \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>Glukoza \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Urea \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Kreatinin \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Holesterol \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>HDL-holesterol \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>LDL-holesterol \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Trigliceridi-\u00a0 3\u20ac<br \/>AST \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>ALT \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>GGT \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>LDH \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Ukupni bilirubin \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Direktni bilirubin \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Amilaza \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>ALP -2\u20ac<br \/>Proteini \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Albumin \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Mokra\u0107na kiselina \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Gvo\u017e\u0111e \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>TIBC \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>UIBC \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>CK \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>CK-MB \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Magnezijum \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Fosfor \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Ukupni kalcijum \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Jonizovani kalcijum \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Natrijum \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Kalijum \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Hloridi \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Prokalcitonin \u2013 25\u20ac<br \/>Interleukin-6 (IL-6) \u2013 40\u20ac<br \/>Transferin \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>Feritin \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>HbA1C \u2013 14\u20ac<br \/>Fruktozamin \u2013 6\u20ac<br \/>ACE \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>Beta Cross Laps \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Osteokalcin \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>hs Troponin \u2013 10\u20ac<br \/>Klirens uree \u00a0\u2013 7\u20ac<br \/>Klirens kreatinina \u2013 7\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>KOAGULACIJA<\/strong><\/h4><p>Fibrinogen \u2013 4\u20ac<br \/>APTT \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>Protrombinsko vrijeme\/INR \u2013 4\u20ac<br \/>D-dimer \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Vrijeme krvarenja \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Vrijeme koagulacije \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Protein C \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Protein S \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>LA 1 \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Antitrombin III \u2013 15\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>IMUNOLOGIJA-SPECIFI\u010cNI PROTEINI<\/strong><\/h4><p>Reuma faktor \u2013 4\u20ac<br \/>Anti CCP \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>ASTO \u2013 4\u20ac<br \/>WALLER ROSE \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>ANA \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>ds DNA-M \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>ds DNA-G \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>At na tkivnu transglutaminazu IgA \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>At na tkivnu transglutaminazu IgG \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Kardiolipinska antitijela IgM \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Kardiolipinska antitijela IgG \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Gliadin-A \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Gliadin-G \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Beta 2 glikoprotein-M \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Beta 2 glikoprotein-G \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>At na glutamat dekarboksilazu (GAD) IgG \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>At na tirozin fosfatazu (IA2) IgG \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>Anti ovarijalna antitijela \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>Anti spermatozoidna antitijela \u2013 35<br \/>Helicobacter pylori IgA \u2013 13\u20ac<br \/>Helicobakter pylori IgG \u2013 13\u20ac<br \/>Imunoglobulin A \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>Imunoglobulin M \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>Imunoglobulin G \u2013 11\u20ac<br \/>Imunoglobulin E \u2013 11\u20ac<br \/>C \u2013 3 \u2013 5\u20ac<br \/>C \u2013 4 \u2013 5\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>HORMONI<\/strong><\/h4><p>TSH \u2013 6\u20ac<br \/>T3 \u2013 6\u20ac<br \/>T4 \u2013 6\u20ac<br \/>FT3 \u2013 11\u20ac<br \/>FT4 \u2013 11\u20ac<br \/>TgAt \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Anti TPO \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Anti TSHR \u2013 25\u20ac<br \/>Tireoglobulin \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>Kalcitonin \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Kortizol \u2013 10\u20ac<br \/>PTH \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Insulin \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>C \u2013 peptid \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>Beta HCG \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Tripl test (14 \u2013 19 nedelja) \u2013 45\u20ac<br \/>Dabl test (8 \u2013 13 nedelja) \u2013 38\u20ac<br \/>PAPP \u2013 A \u2013 16\u20ac<br \/>Free \u00a0beta HCG \u2013 17\u20ac<br \/>Free\u00a0 estriol \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>AFP \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>FSH \u2013 7\u20ac<br \/>LH \u2013 7\u20ac<br \/>Prolaktin \u2013 7\u20ac<br \/>Estradiol \u2013 8\u20ac<br \/>Progesteron \u2013 8\u20ac<br \/>Testosteron \u2013 10\u20ac<br \/>Free testosteron \u2013 25\u20ac<br \/>DHEAS \u2013 12\u20ac<br \/>SHBG \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Androstendion \u2013 16\u20ac<br \/>Antimilerov Hormon \u2013 30\u20ac<br \/>Inhibin B \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>17-OHP \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>ACTH \u2013 18\u20ac<br \/>Renin \u2013 30\u20ac<br \/>NT pro-BNP \u2013 40\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>TUMOR MARKERI<\/strong><\/h4><p>PSA \u2013 14\u20ac<br \/>Free PSA \u2013 14\u20ac<br \/>CEA \u2013 14\u20ac<br \/>CA-15-3 \u2013 14\u20ac<br \/>CA-125 \u2013 14\u20ac<br \/>CA-19.9 \u2013 14\u20ac<br \/>CYFRA 21-1 \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>NSE \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>S 100 \u2013 25\u20ac<br \/>CA-72-4 \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>HE-4 \u2013 25\u20ac<br \/>Hromogranin A \u2013 40\u20ac<br \/>5-HIAA \u2013 25\u20ac<br \/>Roma Index (CA-125+ HE-4) \u2013 38\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>OSTALO<\/strong><\/h4><p>Vitamin D \u2013 25\u20ac<br \/>Vitamin B12 \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>VMA \u2013 15\u20ac<br \/>Valproati \u2013 20\u20ac<br \/>Test na okultno krvarenje (bakterijska serologija) -15\u20ac<br \/>Test na Helicobacter pylori Ag (imunohromatografija) -15\u20ac<\/p><h4><strong>URIN<\/strong><\/h4><p>Citohemijska analiza urina \u2013 5\u20ac<\/p><p>Mokra\u0107na kiselina u urinu \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Proteini u urinu \u2013 10\u20ac<br \/>Albumin u urinu \u2013 10\u20ac<br \/>Amilaza u urinu \u2013 2\u20ac<br \/>Kalcijum u urinu \u2013 3\u20ac<br \/>Fosfor u urinu \u2013 3\u20ac<\/p><p>Test na psihoaktivne supstance (panel od 10 testova) \u2013 40\u20ac<br \/>Test na psihoaktivne supstance (panel od 5 testova) \u2013 25\u20ac<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d1bf30e elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d1bf30e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;,&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3a14383\" data-id=\"3a14383\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98fe1b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"98fe1b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class